OL,3,GNEWSALegal threat for Beatties' owners
OL,4,Aover state of site
OL,5,
OL,6,FLegal proceedings are set to be brought
OL,7,Fagainst the owners of the former
OL,8,FBeatties building in Wolverhampton due
OL,9,Fto its "unacceptable state".
OL,11,FThe department store in Victoria Street
OL,12,Fhas been empty since 2019 after the
OL,13,Fcollapse of House of Fraser and has
OL,14,Fsince fallen into disrepair.
OL,16,FThe City of Wolverhampton Council said
OL,17,Fits action against Eden Beatties was
OL,18,Fbecause the owners have "missed
OL,19,Fdeadline after deadline" to comply with
OL,20,Fan order to tidy the site which had now
OL,21,Fbecome "a blight on the city centre".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
